  deep:[{t:"p",text:"**declarative_base vs db.Model.** Plain SQLAlchemy uses `Base = declarative_base()` and needs `__tablename__`; Flask-SQLAlchemy's `db.Model` is a ready base class that also names the table for you and adds `Model.query`."}],
